, 210], "color": "#af3535", "pos": [-2370, 5520], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 174, "type": "Fast Groups Bypasser (rgthree)", "properties": {"customSortAlphabet": "", "matchColors": "red", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "showAllGraphs": true, "sort": "position", "matchTitle": "", "showNav": true, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [328], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [480, 560], "pos": [-1019.9629516601562, 5203.79931640625], "widgets_values": ["9008723b230180bb951520f2b9177a58e9f3a5f6e2c08842a59a386449886f77.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 161, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [279], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#346434", "widgets_values": ["subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the anthropomorphic ox in <Picture 1>, with yellow-orange fur-like skin, a bull head with a light beige snout, small dark eyes, curved grey horns, light tan ears, human-shaped hands with beige palms, and yellow flat-strap sandals.\n<Subject 2> is the cartoon superhero pig in <Picture 2>, with a pink pig face, a wide smile, a red full-body suit with yellow boots and arm cuffs, a chest emblem, and a red helmet with yellow details and crest.\n<Subject 3> is the chubby frog-like creature in <Picture 3>, bright yellow with a pale cream belly, green eyes, and dark grey webbed hands and feet.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1>, <Subject 2>, and <Subject 3> making sassy runway entrances one by one under stage spotlights, then strutting down the catwalk together toward the camera.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the yellow-orange fur, bull head, grey horns, sandals, and overall ox look are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the pink pig face, red suit, yellow boots and cuffs, chest emblem, and red helmet are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the bright yellow body, cream belly, green eyes, and webbed hands and feet are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in a glossy 3D cartoon style on a fashion show runway, with dramatic stage lighting, a long glossy catwalk, and a dark audience backdrop with bokeh lights.\n[Shot 1] A row of bright stage spotlights snaps on and sweeps across the runway, settling into a single follow spot on <Subject 1>, the anthropomorphic ox. It struts to the front of the stage with an exaggerated hip sway, then strikes a sassy pose — one hand on its hip, the other pointing outward, chin lifted — and holds it with a confident smile. The camera holds a medium shot from the front.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the spotlight swings to <Subject 2>, the superhero pig, which enters with a flamboyant strut, throws a peace sign with its right hand, flips its helmet slightly, and freezes in a bold hero pose with its left hand on its hip. It stands beside <Subject 1>.\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.500, the spotlight picks up <Subject 3>, the chubby yellow frog-like creature, which bounces in with a playful swagger, raises one webbed arm in a wave, spins once, and lands in a wide stance with a grin. It joins the other two.\n[Shot 4] At 00:06.000, all three line up side by side and strut down the catwalk together toward the camera in synchronized steps, swaying and striking confident poses with each stride. The spotlights follow them as they walk straight toward the lens, growing larger until they fill the frame in a final group pose, sparkling stage lights flaring behind them.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSharp clicks as the spotlights switch on and swing, rhythmic footsteps echoing on the glossy runway, soft fabric rustles from the outfits, and a burst of camera shutter clicks as the three strike their final pose.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA confident, upbeat fashion-show house beat at a fast tempo with a driving four-on-the-floor kick and punchy synth stabs that build toward the final group reveal."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1980, 5160], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [329], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [480, 560], "pos": [-1560, 5190], "widgets_values": ["a87769e2be48c62ff4ab571e7b1b710544660da5f472b871197620cc1fa5da8a.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 163, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [327], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [480, 560], "pos": [-1560, 5860], "widgets_values": ["2ea8b1b9a920ec09ddbb2d2df48c3c54b628b5dfe9f514225c9e771448b0d640.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 162, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 17}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax H3\n\n[MiniMax H3](https://www.minimax.io/blog/minimax-h3) is MiniMax's general-purpose, omni-modal generation model. It jointly understands text, image, video, and audio, and generates video with **native stereo audio**: voice, sound effects, and music are modeled jointly in a single forward pass, not layered on afterward. Output is up to 2K resolution, 24fps, and up to about 15 seconds.\n\n## ComfyUI links\n- [ComfyUI#15224](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/15224)\n- [🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n## About this workflow\n\nThis template runs the **reference-to-video (ref2va)** task using the `MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo` node. It takes any mix of reference images, videos, and standalone audio, and weaves them into the generation to lock in a character's identity, a style, a motion, a camera move, or a voice.\n\n**Key inputs**\n\n- **ref_images / ref_videos / ref_video_audios / ref_audios**: up to 9 reference images, 3 reference videos (each may carry its own paired soundtrack), and 3 standalone reference audio clips\n- **prompt**: reference the inputs by tag, in the exact order they were connected, for example `<Picture 1>`, `<Video 1>`, `<Audio 1>`, then describe the target scene, motion, and audio\n- **ref_image_size**: `match` scales references down to the generation's resolution (faster); `max` keeps up to a 2048px short edge for stronger identity fidelity, at the cost of speed since reference tokens ride along every sampling step\n- **width / height**: set via Resolution Selector.\n- **duration (seconds)**: converted to a valid frame `length` by the Math Expression node\n\n**Sampling and decode**\n\n- Sampler: `res_multistep`. `beta` or `normal` scheduler tends to outperform `simple` for reference-heavy prompts like this one\n- The sampler's joint audio+video `LATENT` output feeds directly into both `VAEDecode` (video, `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16`) and `VAEDecodeAudio` (audio, `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32`); each decode node automatically pulls its own half out of the packed latent. `CreateVideo` then muxes the two into a single MP4 with synced sound\n- The diffusion model here is `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`, a different set of weights from the `fl2va` model used by the t2v/i2v templates\n\nRef2va's output is very sensitive to prompt wording; matching the reference tags precisely and being explicit about which reference drives which part of the shot tends to work best."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax H3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 890], "pos": [-790, 7090], "id": 116, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## Model Links\n[🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors)\n- [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n\n**diffusion_models**\n\n- [minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.